      "id": "DK4_GRAND_RACE_HELP_138168",
      "title": "Map",
      "speaker": "Grand Race help system",
      "source_meaning": "The race map shows positions of ships, finish, checkpoints and supply points. Player ships are red, blue, yellow, green in join order. Finish has G, checkpoints red circles, supply points light blue circles. Passed checkpoints vanish from your map.",
