      "id": "DK4_GRAND_RACE_HELP_138044",
      "title": "Basic Rules",
      "speaker": "Grand Race help system",
      "source_meaning": "Control by touch screen, not directional pad. Pass seven checkpoints and finish first to win. Any checkpoint order is permitted, but all must be passed before finishing. Race lasts until everybody finishes.",
      "context": "The player opens this page from Grand Race, reads it alongside the related rules and can return to the menu.",
      "localization_note": "The existing text explains the Touch Screen restriction, all seven checkpoints in any order, the first finisher and continued play for the others.",
      "english": "Control the race with the Touch Screen; the D-pad cannot be used. Pass all seven checkpoints and reach the finish first to win. You can pass the checkpoints in any order, but you cannot finish until you've passed them all. The race continues until everyone finishes.",
      "current_English": "Control the race with the Touch Screen; the D-pad cannot be used. Pass all seven checkpoints and reach the finish first to win. You can pass the checkpoints in any order, but you cannot finish until you've passed them all. The race continues until everyone finishes.",
      "Japanese": "レースはタッチスクリーンで操作します。十\n字ボタンでは操作できません。\n７つのチェックポイントを通過して、最初に\nゴールインしたプレイヤーが勝利です。\nチェックポイントの順番は決まっていません\nが、すべてのチェックポイントを通過しない\nと、ゴールできません。\n全員がゴールするまでレースは続きます。",
      "decision": "retention",
